  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.1 (2026-06-30) - Documentation and Quality Improvements\n\n      Documentation Enhancements:\n      • Completed XML documentation for all private members and methods\n      • Added detailed performance optimization documentation (14 distinct optimizations)\n      • Enhanced inline documentation with usage examples and design rationale\n      • Improved cross-references using proper <see cref/> tags\n\n      String Building Optimizations:\n      • StringBuilder capacity pre-computation for ICollection<T> (no size threshold)\n      • Fast-path iterative joining for small lists (1-3 items) vs StringBuilder for larger collections\n      • Zero-allocation string building using string.Create and span operations\n      • Tuple formatting optimized for up to 8 elements (primary tuple structure)\n      • Local method pattern for reduced allocations in tight loops\n\n      Code Quality:\n      • Enhanced null handling with explicit fallback strategies\n      • Improved error handling in Stream formatting with DEBUG diagnostics\n      • Thread-safe concurrent caching for hot-path operations\n      • Comprehensive XML documentation for all public and private APIs\n\n      For details: https://github.com/CsabaDu/Portamical/blob/master/Portamical.Core.Formatting/README.md",
